  "duration_s": 340.380998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九四九年十月一号下午三点，天安门广场人山人海，锣鼓喧天。中华人民共和国成立了，那是全中国最荣耀的时刻，没有之一。就在几公里外的协和医院产房里，一个穿白大褂的女人安安静静的守着一个产妇，她叫林巧智。那天，她其实收到了一张红底金字的请柬，开始开国大典观礼邀请函，多少人挤破脑袋都进不去的地方。他拿起来看了一眼，搁在桌上，转身进了产房。有人追着问林大夫，这么大的喜事，您怎么不去，他头也没回，我是大夫，产房里有产妇等着我去天安门干什么？他听听开国大典啊，对普通人来说，一辈子赶不上一回的事儿，他说不去就不去，他是谁。中国科学院第一位女院士，中国妇产科学的奠基人。一辈子没结婚没孩子，却亲手接生了五万多个新生命。五万多个，您住那小区可能都没这么多人，这五万人里有一个，您肯定认识袁隆平，一九三零年，协和医院的出生档案上接生一生一栏写着三个英文单词KOG令，还有一位钟南山院士见着他还得规规矩矩喊一声姑婆。您说一个连院士都要喊姑婆的人，为什么偏偏一辈子守着产房？因为他五岁那年，母亲病逝了，他跪在床边，眼睁睁看着妈妈闭上眼睛，哭的撕心裂肺，却什么都做不了。从那天起，他就发誓，我要当医生，我要让别人的妈不再死。一九二一年，他考协和医学院百里挑一，考最后一门英语。考场里一个女生中暑晕倒了，别的考生都低头做题，只有他把笔一扔，冲过去救人。等他忙活完，考试也结束了，他以为自己落榜了，可一个月后，录取通知书到家了。考官说，能在最要紧的关头，放下前程去救人，这就是当医生的料，分数可以补考，人品补不了。进了协和。他选了又脏又累的妇产科医院。有规定女医生结婚就得走人，他二话没说直接把自己嫁给了医院，一辈子没结婚，一辈问他后悔吗？他说，我最爱听的是东音，就是婴儿出生后的第一声啼哭。他给孕妇听台心前，总先把冰凉的听诊器贴在自己手心里热。他说，产妇已经在受罪了，能少一点粮就少一点粮。一九三九年，他去美国进修，美国顶级医院抢着流淌，条件开的特别高。他说，科学可以没有国界，一生不能没有祖国收拾了箱子回国。一九四一年，太平洋战争，爆发，协和医院被迫关门。他就在东塘子胡同开了间小诊所，穷人没钱，看病，还倒切鸡蛋，红糖，兵荒马乱的年月。他心里只有一个念头，大人孩子能活下来，比什么都强。一九四九年，解放前期，傅作义将军的夫人给他送来一张亲笔签名的机票，拿着他能去任何城市，多少人用金条都换不来，他却谢绝了。我的病人还在这儿，我哪儿也不去。所以开国大典那天他不去不是不爱这个国家，他心里有一杆秤，产房就是他的天安门娃娃的啼哭，就是他成功的礼炮。一九八三年四月二十二号，八十二岁的他走了，弥留之际，他断断续续喊的是快快拿产钱来。他留下一份遗嘱，三万元积蓄，全部捐给幼儿园、托儿所遗体捐给医学院做研究，骨灰洒回故乡鼓浪屿的海面。他把最后一点东西都还给了医学。什么是真正的体面？不是顺境里的风光，是绝境与还肯弯下腰。什么叫国之脊梁？就是那个在开国大典那天安安静静守在产房里的女人。如果您也被他打动了，点亮红心评论区打上致敬两个字，把这条视频转发给家里的长辈，看看，收藏起来，等孙辈放学讲给他们听听，关注我，下期给您讲述。林巧志说，民族的未来都在产妇的肚子里。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 3030,
      "text": "一九四九年十月一号下午三点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3890,
      "end_ms": 6030,
      "text": "天安门广场人山人海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6370,
      "end_ms": 7290,
      "text": "锣鼓喧天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8150,
      "end_ms": 10210,
      "text": "中华人民共和国成立了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10570,
      "end_ms": 12850,
      "text": "那是全中国最荣耀的时刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13450,
      "end_ms": 14350,
      "text": "没有之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15070,
      "end_ms": 17750,
      "text": "就在几公里外的协和医院产房里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18090,
      "end_ms": 22470,
      "text": "一个穿白大褂的女人安安静静的守着一个产妇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22990,
      "end_ms": 24150,
      "text": "她叫林巧智。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24930,
      "end_ms": 25410,
      "text": "那天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25690,
      "end_ms": 29250,
      "text": "她其实收到了一张红底金字的请柬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29670,
      "end_ms": 31900,
      "text": "开始开国大典观礼邀请函，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32200,
      "end_ms": 34780,
      "text": "多少人挤破脑袋都进不去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00014",
      "start_ms": 34780,
      "end_ms": 35960,
      "text": "他拿起来看了一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00015",
      "start_ms": 36040,
      "end_ms": 36800,
      "text": "搁在桌上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36960,
      "end_ms": 38480,
      "text": "转身进了产房。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39060,
      "end_ms": 41160,
      "text": "有人追着问林大夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41380,
      "end_ms": 42420,
      "text": "这么大的喜事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00019",
      "start_ms": 42600,
      "end_ms": 43440,
      "text": "您怎么不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00020",
      "start_ms": 43920,
      "end_ms": 45060,
      "text": "他头也没回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00021",
      "start_ms": 45300,
      "end_ms": 46060,
      "text": "我是大夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00022",
      "start_ms": 46560,
      "end_ms": 49420,
      "text": "产房里有产妇等着我去天安门干什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00023",
      "start_ms": 49720,
      "end_ms": 51820,
      "text": "他听听开国大典啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00024",
      "start_ms": 51880,
      "end_ms": 53320,
      "text": "对普通人来说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00025",
      "start_ms": 53320,
      "end_ms": 55360,
      "text": "一辈子赶不上一回的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00026",
      "start_ms": 55660,
      "end_ms": 56980,
      "text": "他说不去就不去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00027",
      "start_ms": 57460,
      "end_ms": 58060,
      "text": "他是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00028",
      "start_ms": 58580,
      "end_ms": 61075,
      "text": "中国科学院第一位女院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00029",
      "start_ms": 61660,
      "end_ms": 63835,
      "text": "中国妇产科学的奠基人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00030",
      "start_ms": 64210,
      "end_ms": 66360,
      "text": "一辈子没结婚没孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00031",
      "start_ms": 66440,
      "end_ms": 69625,
      "text": "却亲手接生了五万多个新生命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70570,
      "end_ms": 71555,
      "text": "五万多个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00033",
      "start_ms": 71890,
      "end_ms": 74355,
      "text": "您住那小区可能都没这么多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00034",
      "start_ms": 75450,
      "end_ms": 78180,
      "text": "这五万人里有一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00035",
      "start_ms": 78180,
      "end_ms": 81795,
      "text": "您肯定认识袁隆平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00036",
      "start_ms": 82740,
      "end_ms": 83780,
      "text": "一九三零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00037",
      "start_ms": 84000,
      "end_ms": 91500,
      "text": "协和医院的出生档案上接生一生一栏写着三个英文单词KOG令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00038",
      "start_ms": 92080,
      "end_ms": 99765,
      "text": "还有一位钟南山院士见着他还得规规矩矩喊一声姑婆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00039",
      "start_ms": 100160,
      "end_ms": 103985,
      "text": "您说一个连院士都要喊姑婆的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00040",
      "start_ms": 104530,
      "end_ms": 107365,
      "text": "为什么偏偏一辈子守着产房？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00041",
      "start_ms": 108400,
      "end_ms": 109725,
      "text": "因为他五岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00042",
      "start_ms": 109990,
      "end_ms": 111055,
      "text": "母亲病逝了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00043",
      "start_ms": 111480,
      "end_ms": 112615,
      "text": "他跪在床边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00044",
      "start_ms": 113040,
      "end_ms": 115485,
      "text": "眼睁睁看着妈妈闭上眼睛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00045",
      "start_ms": 115900,
      "end_ms": 117365,
      "text": "哭的撕心裂肺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00046",
      "start_ms": 117820,
      "end_ms": 118985,
      "text": "却什么都做不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00047",
      "start_ms": 119970,
      "end_ms": 120770,
      "text": "从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00048",
      "start_ms": 120770,
      "end_ms": 121470,
      "text": "他就发誓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00049",
      "start_ms": 122050,
      "end_ms": 123030,
      "text": "我要当医生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00050",
      "start_ms": 123210,
      "end_ms": 126210,
      "text": "我要让别人的妈不再死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00051",
      "start_ms": 127190,
      "end_ms": 128250,
      "text": "一九二一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00052",
      "start_ms": 128450,
      "end_ms": 130930,
      "text": "他考协和医学院百里挑一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00053",
      "start_ms": 131270,
      "end_ms": 132790,
      "text": "考最后一门英语。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00054",
      "start_ms": 133170,
      "end_ms": 135590,
      "text": "考场里一个女生中暑晕倒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00055",
      "start_ms": 136190,
      "end_ms": 138110,
      "text": "别的考生都低头做题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00056",
      "start_ms": 138690,
      "end_ms": 140150,
      "text": "只有他把笔一扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00057",
      "start_ms": 140490,
      "end_ms": 141470,
      "text": "冲过去救人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00058",
      "start_ms": 142390,
      "end_ms": 143390,
      "text": "等他忙活完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00059",
      "start_ms": 143550,
      "end_ms": 144810,
      "text": "考试也结束了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00060",
      "start_ms": 144810,
      "end_ms": 146130,
      "text": "他以为自己落榜了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00061",
      "start_ms": 146850,
      "end_ms": 147710,
      "text": "可一个月后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00062",
      "start_ms": 147710,
      "end_ms": 149365,
      "text": "录取通知书到家了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00063",
      "start_ms": 149980,
      "end_ms": 150660,
      "text": "考官说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00064",
      "start_ms": 151480,
      "end_ms": 153400,
      "text": "能在最要紧的关头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00065",
      "start_ms": 153440,
      "end_ms": 155200,
      "text": "放下前程去救人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00066",
      "start_ms": 156160,
      "end_ms": 157720,
      "text": "这就是当医生的料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00067",
      "start_ms": 158600,
      "end_ms": 159800,
      "text": "分数可以补考，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00068",
      "start_ms": 160340,
      "end_ms": 161360,
      "text": "人品补不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00069",
      "start_ms": 161780,
      "end_ms": 162560,
      "text": "进了协和。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00070",
      "start_ms": 162860,
      "end_ms": 166320,
      "text": "他选了又脏又累的妇产科医院。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00071",
      "start_ms": 166320,
      "end_ms": 168960,
      "text": "有规定女医生结婚就得走人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00072",
      "start_ms": 169260,
      "end_ms": 172420,
      "text": "他二话没说直接把自己嫁给了医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00073",
      "start_ms": 172980,
      "end_ms": 174160,
      "text": "一辈子没结婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00074",
      "start_ms": 175000,
      "end_ms": 176260,
      "text": "一辈问他后悔吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00075",
      "start_ms": 177200,
      "end_ms": 177640,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00076",
      "start_ms": 178480,
      "end_ms": 180045,
      "text": "我最爱听的是东音，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00077",
      "start_ms": 180260,
      "end_ms": 183095,
      "text": "就是婴儿出生后的第一声啼哭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00078",
      "start_ms": 184010,
      "end_ms": 185525,
      "text": "他给孕妇听台心前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00079",
      "start_ms": 186140,
      "end_ms": 190705,
      "text": "总先把冰凉的听诊器贴在自己手心里热。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00080",
      "start_ms": 191310,
      "end_ms": 191790,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00081",
      "start_ms": 192140,
      "end_ms": 193715,
      "text": "产妇已经在受罪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00082",
      "start_ms": 194140,
      "end_ms": 196605,
      "text": "能少一点粮就少一点粮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00083",
      "start_ms": 197070,
      "end_ms": 198225,
      "text": "一九三九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00084",
      "start_ms": 198560,
      "end_ms": 199675,
      "text": "他去美国进修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00085",
      "start_ms": 200160,
      "end_ms": 202100,
      "text": "美国顶级医院抢着流淌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00086",
      "start_ms": 202400,
      "end_ms": 203755,
      "text": "条件开的特别高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00087",
      "start_ms": 204210,
      "end_ms": 204675,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00088",
      "start_ms": 205060,
      "end_ms": 206605,
      "text": "科学可以没有国界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00089",
      "start_ms": 206940,
      "end_ms": 210790,
      "text": "一生不能没有祖国收拾了箱子回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00090",
      "start_ms": 210870,
      "end_ms": 211815,
      "text": "一九四一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00091",
      "start_ms": 212100,
      "end_ms": 212960,
      "text": "太平洋战争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00092",
      "start_ms": 212960,
      "end_ms": 213345,
      "text": "爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00093",
      "start_ms": 213770,
      "end_ms": 215365,
      "text": "协和医院被迫关门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00094",
      "start_ms": 216020,
      "end_ms": 219095,
      "text": "他就在东塘子胡同开了间小诊所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00095",
      "start_ms": 219840,
      "end_ms": 220760,
      "text": "穷人没钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00096",
      "start_ms": 220780,
      "end_ms": 221245,
      "text": "看病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00097",
      "start_ms": 221530,
      "end_ms": 222405,
      "text": "还倒切鸡蛋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00098",
      "start_ms": 224210,
      "end_ms": 224785,
      "text": "红糖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00099",
      "start_ms": 225670,
      "end_ms": 227090,
      "text": "兵荒马乱的年月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00100",
      "start_ms": 227330,
      "end_ms": 229115,
      "text": "他心里只有一个念头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00101",
      "start_ms": 229920,
      "end_ms": 231580,
      "text": "大人孩子能活下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00102",
      "start_ms": 231740,
      "end_ms": 232755,
      "text": "比什么都强。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00103",
      "start_ms": 233700,
      "end_ms": 234740,
      "text": "一九四九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00104",
      "start_ms": 234760,
      "end_ms": 235835,
      "text": "解放前期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00105",
      "start_ms": 236460,
      "end_ms": 241455,
      "text": "傅作义将军的夫人给他送来一张亲笔签名的机票，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00106",
      "start_ms": 242030,
      "end_ms": 243875,
      "text": "拿着他能去任何城市，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00107",
      "start_ms": 244520,
      "end_ms": 246525,
      "text": "多少人用金条都换不来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00108",
      "start_ms": 247120,
      "end_ms": 248115,
      "text": "他却谢绝了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00109",
      "start_ms": 249850,
      "end_ms": 251125,
      "text": "我的病人还在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00110",
      "start_ms": 252520,
      "end_ms": 253495,
      "text": "我哪儿也不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00111",
      "start_ms": 254680,
      "end_ms": 260765,
      "text": "所以开国大典那天他不去不是不爱这个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00112",
      "start_ms": 261690,
      "end_ms": 262985,
      "text": "他心里有一杆秤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00113",
      "start_ms": 264100,
      "end_ms": 268045,
      "text": "产房就是他的天安门娃娃的啼哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00114",
      "start_ms": 268430,
      "end_ms": 269815,
      "text": "就是他成功的礼炮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00115",
      "start_ms": 270340,
      "end_ms": 272165,
      "text": "一九八三年四月二十二号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00116",
      "start_ms": 272510,
      "end_ms": 274125,
      "text": "八十二岁的他走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00117",
      "start_ms": 274360,
      "end_ms": 275125,
      "text": "弥留之际，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00118",
      "start_ms": 275390,
      "end_ms": 280535,
      "text": "他断断续续喊的是快快拿产钱来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00119",
      "start_ms": 281410,
      "end_ms": 282805,
      "text": "他留下一份遗嘱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00120",
      "start_ms": 283590,
      "end_ms": 284815,
      "text": "三万元积蓄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00121",
      "start_ms": 285210,
      "end_ms": 291575,
      "text": "全部捐给幼儿园、托儿所遗体捐给医学院做研究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00122",
      "start_ms": 292150,
      "end_ms": 296065,
      "text": "骨灰洒回故乡鼓浪屿的海面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00123",
      "start_ms": 296970,
      "end_ms": 300765,
      "text": "他把最后一点东西都还给了医学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00124",
      "start_ms": 301780,
      "end_ms": 303325,
      "text": "什么是真正的体面？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00125",
      "start_ms": 303930,
      "end_ms": 305645,
      "text": "不是顺境里的风光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00126",
      "start_ms": 306210,
      "end_ms": 308475,
      "text": "是绝境与还肯弯下腰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00127",
      "start_ms": 309060,
      "end_ms": 310485,
      "text": "什么叫国之脊梁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00128",
      "start_ms": 311110,
      "end_ms": 316665,
      "text": "就是那个在开国大典那天安安静静守在产房里的女人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00129",
      "start_ms": 316930,
      "end_ms": 318595,
      "text": "如果您也被他打动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00130",
      "start_ms": 318900,
      "end_ms": 323205,
      "text": "点亮红心评论区打上致敬两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00131",
      "start_ms": 323810,
      "end_ms": 326910,
      "text": "把这条视频转发给家里的长辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00132",
      "start_ms": 326990,
      "end_ms": 327455,
      "text": "看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00133",
      "start_ms": 327900,
      "end_ms": 328755,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00134",
      "start_ms": 329190,
      "end_ms": 332165,
      "text": "等孙辈放学讲给他们听听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00135",
      "start_ms": 332690,
      "end_ms": 333330,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00136",
      "start_ms": 333510,
      "end_ms": 334725,
      "text": "下期给您讲述。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00137",
      "start_ms": 335200,
      "end_ms": 336145,
      "text": "林巧志说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef0c4e61b567a541_s00138",
      "start_ms": 336510,
      "end_ms": 340215,
      "text": "民族的未来都在产妇的肚子里。"
    }
  ],
